extraction_instructions.output_format:
Return one JSON object with exactly the key events. Put Trigger first in each item, then Sentence_IDs, then Event. For source s001 "The researchers compared both scores.", the output is:
{"events":[{"Trigger":"compared","Sentence_IDs":["s001"],"Event":"The researchers compared both scores."}]}
Return {"events":[]} when the passage contains no supported events.
